{"id":"u-28ff3787-67bf-473d-bf8f-3e11a6462a5e","src":"community","title":"The Sacrifice","author":"Iron Strength Lab","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/7mhSob-untitled-program","desc":"\"The Sacrifice\" is an advanced 8-week powerbuilding framework engineered to drive elite strength gains while maximizing hypertrophy. Built on an Upper/Lower/Upper/Lower/Upper 5-day split, this program bridges the gap between raw powerlifting output and high-intensity golden era body composition. Designed for experienced lifters, it strategically pairs heavy compound anchors with relentless accessory work inspired by the training philosophies of Tom Platz and Mike Mentzer.\n\nPeriodization Strategy\nThe program operates on a distinct two-phase periodization model designed to systematically shatter plateaus:\n\n Phase 1: \nBase Strength & Concentric Failure (Weeks 1–4): Focuses on heavy, controlled compound work (RPE 9) to build foundational power, paired with high-intensity isolation sets taken to absolute concentric failure (RPE 10) using strict 3-second negative tempos.\n \nPhase 2: \nHeavy Duty Overload & Beyond Failure (Weeks 5–8): Shifts primary lifts into lower rep brackets with maximum effort (RPE 10) and static holds. Accessory movements transition to beyond-failure intensity techniques (RPE 11+), incorporating Mentzer-style rest-pause reps, forced slow negatives, and double drop sets to force deep muscular adaptation.\n\nProgram Structure & Focus\n\nEach training session is built around a heavy compound movement and supported by targeted isolation work and specialized core integration:\n \nUpper Body Days (3x/Week): Prioritize chest, back, shoulder, and arm mass through high-volume pressing and pulling variants.\n \nLower Body Days (2x/Week): Focus on maximal squat/deadlift loading paired with high-rep, deep-stretch leg accessories designed for complete posterior chain and quad development.\n \nCore Integration: Every session concludes with a specific core movement selected to reinforce spinal stability, anti-extension, or anti-rotation without creating excessive lower back fatigue.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-08T18:30:47.448Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["UPPER 1","LOWER 1","UPPER 2","LOWER 2","UPPER 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":9,"x":3},{"r":10,"rpe":9}],"note":"Last set is a back off set."},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7},{"r":6,"rpe":8},{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Absolute concentric failure on sets 4 & 5"},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled 3 sec negative"},{"n":"Pullover (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8},{"r":12,"rpe":9},{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":3}],"note":"If movement feels awkward, perform straight bar cable variation"},{"n":"Ab Wheel","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":9,"x":3},{"r":15,"rpe":10}],"note":"Last set, drop weight 30% and perform set to failure"},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2},{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Narrow stance w/ heels elevated"},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":10,"x":5}],"note":"2 sec. stretch & 2 sec. contraction"},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":10,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":9,"x":3},{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}],"note":"Gironda Sternum Chin-Up"},{"n":"Bench Press (Wide Grip)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8},{"r":6,"rpe":9},{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":4}],"note":"Perform these as “cheat curls” with a controlled negative"},{"n":"Lying Tricep Exte